Description: compression library - runtime (upstream 1.4 rebuild)
 zlib 1.4 built from upstream source. Replaces Debian's 1:1.2.13.dfsg-1 to fix
 CVE-2026-27171 (crc32_combine infinite loop on negative length) without
 introducing CVE-2026-85091 (zlib 1.3.1.2-1.3.2).
